    "intro_narrative": "Welcome, apprentices, to the Sanctum of Archmage Orion. The master has been missing for moons, and his protective wards are rapidly deteriorating. The arcane threads holding this tower together are unraveling, threatening to cast the entire structure into the astral void. Your only hope of survival and preserving the master's legacy lies in unlocking The Grand Reliquary, a vault said to hold his ultimate creation. However, Orion was famously paranoid. He scattered his knowledge across enchanted astrolabes, magical lodestones, and cryptic spell-unbinders. You must decipher the arcane data flows, channeling magical energy from simple resonance crystals all the way up to complex navigational arrays. Pay close attention to how the magical devices interact; many require specific streams of arcane data from other tools to awaken. Time is short, and the magic is fading. Harness the leylines and unlock the Reliquary before the Sanctum is lost forever.",
    "narrative_style": "fantasy"
  },
